\mt1 THE GOSPEL ACCORDING TO ST. JOHN  
\c 7  
\p
\v 1 \w After\w* these \w things\w* \w Jesus\w* \w walked\w* \w in\w* \w Galilee\w*: \w for\w* he \w would\w* \w not\w* \w walk\w* \w in\w* \w Jewry\w*, \w because\w* the \w Jews\w* \w sought\w* to \w kill\w* \w him\w*.  
