\v 6 \w Then\w* \w Jesus\w* \w said\w* unto \w them\w*, \wj  \+w My\+w* \+w time\+w* \+w is\+w* \+w not yet\+w* \+w come\+w*: \+w but\+w* \+w your\+w* \+w time\+w* \+w is\+w* \+w alway\+w* \+w ready\+w*.\wj*  
