\p
\v 10 ¶ \w But\w* \w when\w* \w his\w* \w brethren\w* were gone \w up\w*, \w then\w* \w went\w* \w he\w* \w also\w* \w up\w* \w unto\w* the \w feast\w*, \w not\w* \w openly\w*, \w but\w* as it \w were\w* \w in\w* \w secret\w*.  
