\v 18 \wj  \+w He that speaketh\+w* \+w of\+w* \+w himself\+w* \+w seeketh\+w* \+w his own\+w* \+w glory\+w*: \+w but\+w* \+w he that seeketh\+w* \+w his\+w* \+w glory\+w* \+w that sent\+w* \+w him\+w*, \+w the same\+w* \+w is\+w* \+w true\+w*, \+w and\+w* \+w no\+w* \+w unrighteousness\+w* \+w is\+w* \+w in\+w* \+w him\+w*.\wj*  
\v 19 \wj  \+w Did\+w* \+w not\+w* \+w Moses\+w* \+w give\+w* \+w you\+w* \+w the law\+w*, \+w and\+w* \+add yet\+add* \+w none\+w* \+w of\+w* \+w you\+w* \+w keepeth\+w* \+w the law\+w*? \+w Why\+w* \+w go ye about\+w* \+w to kill\+w* \+w me\+w*?\wj*  
