\v 22 \wj  \+w Moses\+w* \+w therefore\+w* \+w gave\+w* \+w unto you\+w* \+w circumcision\+w*; (\+w not\+w* \+w because\+w* \+w it is\+w* \+w of\+w* \+w Moses\+w*, \+w but\+w* \+w of\+w* \+w the fathers\+w*;) \+w and\+w* \+w ye\+w* \+w on\+w* \+w the sabbath day\+w* \+w circumcise\+w* \+w a man\+w*.\wj*  
\v 23 \wj  \+w If\+w* \+w a man\+w* \+w on\+w* \+w the sabbath day\+w* \+w receive\+w* \+w circumcision\+w*, \+w that\+w* \+w the law\+w* \+w of Moses\+w* \+w should\+w* \+w not\+w* \+w be broken\+w*; \+w are ye angry\+w* \+w at me\+w*, \+w because\+w* \+w I have made\+w* \+w a man\+w* \+w every whit\+w* \+w whole\+w* \+w on\+w* \+w the sabbath day\+w*?\wj*  
\v 24 \wj  \+w Judge\+w* \+w not\+w* \+w according to\+w* \+w the appearance\+w*, \+w but\+w* \+w judge\+w* \+w righteous\+w* \+w judgment\+w*.\wj*  
\v 25 \w Then\w* \w said\w* \w some\w* \w of\w* them of \w Jerusalem\w*, \w Is\w* \w not\w* \w this\w* \w he\w*, \w whom\w* they \w seek\w* to \w kill\w*?  
