\p
\v 32 ¶ The \w Pharisees\w* \w heard\w* \w that\w* the \w people\w* \w murmured\w* such \w things\w* \w concerning\w* \w him\w*; \w and\w* the \w Pharisees\w* \w and\w* the chief \w priests\w* \w sent\w* \w officers\w* \w to\w* \w take\w* \w him\w*.  
