\v 34 \wj  \+w Ye shall seek\+w* \+w me\+w*, \+w and\+w* \+w shall\+w* \+w not\+w* \+w find\+w* \+add me\+add*: \+w and\+w* \+w where\+w* \+w I\+w* \+w am\+w*, \+add thither\+add* \+w ye\+w* \+w cannot\+w* \+w come\+w*.\wj*  
