\p
\v 12 ¶ \w Then\w* \w spake\w* \w Jesus\w* \w again\w* unto \w them\w*, \w saying\w*, \wj  \+w I\+w* \+w am\+w* \+w the light\+w* \+w of the world\+w*: \+w he that followeth\+w* \+w me\+w* \+w shall\+w* \+w not\+w* \+w walk\+w* \+w in\+w* \+w darkness\+w*, \+w but\+w* \+w shall have\+w* \+w the light\+w* \+w of life\+w*.\wj*  
